  "description": "The Core City Commuter Electric Bike is an electric bike designed specifically for urban commuting. It features comfortable saddle and handlebars for a more comfortable ride. Additionally, it comes equipped with a peak 750W motor and a 13AH built-in lithium battery, providing up to 50 kilometers of range, so you don't have to worry about running out of power. The Core City Commuter Electric Bike also has a 7-speed gear system, allowing you to adjust to different road conditions and your own needs, making it easy to handle various riding scenarios. Furthermore, it has a powerful braking system to ensure your safety while riding. In summary, the Core City Commuter Electric Bike is a powerful, stable, comfortable and practical electric bike, making it the perfect choice for your urban commuting needs.",
